-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">¡Buenas noches! ¿Listo para cenar?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:5;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"167\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 125.2pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 15.7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Good night!<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.1pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\n  line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">¡Buenas\r\n  noches! (antes de irse a dormir)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"135\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:101.35pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Good night! See you tomorrow.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.1pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">¡Buenas noches! Nos vemos mañana.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:6;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"167\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 125.2pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 15.7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Bye! / Goodbye!<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.1pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\n  line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">¡Adiós!<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"135\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:101.35pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Bye! Talk to you later.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.1pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso