rgin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Example of a situation in English/Ejemplo\r\n  de situación en inglés</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 136.1pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 62.15pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Example translation/Traducción de\r\n  situación</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"167\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 125.2pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 15.7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">No way!<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.1pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\n  line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">¡No puede\r\n  ser!</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"135\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:101.35pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Oh no!, no way!<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.1pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Oh no, ¡No puede ser!<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:2;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"167\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 125.2pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 15.7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n  normal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Are you serious?<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.1pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\n  line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">¿Hablas\r\n  en serio?</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"135\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:101.35pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">What? Are you serious?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.1pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">¿Qué? ¿Hablas en serio?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:3;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"167\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 125.2pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 15.7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n  normal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">You’re not going to\r\n  believe this.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.1pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\n  line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">No vas a\r\n  creer esto.</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"135\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:101.35pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Hey, you\'re not going to believe this.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.1pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Oye, no vas a creer esto.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:4;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"167\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 125.2pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor windowtext windowtext; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 15.7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\n  normal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Oh, my God! (OMG)<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.1pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:center;\r\n  line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">¡Oh, Dios\r\n  mío!</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"135\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:101.35pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Oh, my god, I love this!<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"181\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:136.1pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:15.7pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">¡Oh,Dios mío!, ¡me encanta!<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><div class=\"important-box\"><div class=\"bloque-label\">⚠️ IMPORTANTE</div><p>En la parte final de la lección encontraras un video explicativo y unos juegos interactivos que te ayudaran a comprender mejor el tema.</p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></b></p><p><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></b></p>', '9');
INSERT INTO `temas` (`id_tema`, `id_materia`, `id_unidad`, `nombre`, `descripcion`, `contenido`, `grado`) VALUES
(51, 5, 22, 'Past Continuous', 'Pasado Continuo', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">El<b> <i>past\r\ncontinuous o past progressive </i></b>en inglés es un tiempo verbal que\r\nutilizamos para expresar<b> </b>acciones que empezaron a ocurrir en el pasado y\r\nque aún no termina de ocurrir cuando el interlocutor está narrando los hechos.\r\nEs común el uso de este tiempo verbal para narrar historias que tuvieron lugar\r\nen el pasado. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">La\r\nclave para reconocerlo es cuando el verbo principal de la oración tiene la\r\nterminación<b> -ing</b> (-ando -endo en español) y se encuentra acompañado de\r\nlos verbos auxiliares <b>was</b> o <b>were</b>.&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">En el pasado\r\ncontinuo, el auxiliar que se utiliza es el verbo <b><u>to be</u></b> en pasado: was o were, dependiendo del sujeto:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">He,\r\nshe, it<b> → was.</b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">You,\r\nwe, they<b> → were.</b><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-left:21.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">ESTRUCTURA BASE:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype id=\"_x0000_t75\" coordsize=\"21600,21600\"\r\n o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\" filled=\"f\"\r\n stroked=\"f\">\r\n <v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"/>\r\n <v:formulas>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"/>\r\n </v:formulas>\r\n <v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"/>\r\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\"/>\r\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"Imagen_x0020_2\" o:spid=\"_x0000_s1026\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"\r\n alt=\"Past Continuous Tense – Definition, Structure, Usage &amp; Examples\"\r\n style=\'position:absolute;margin-left:0;margin-top:.35pt;width:266.65pt;\r\n height:213pt;z-index:-251658240;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square;\r\n mso-width-percent:0;mso-height-percent:0;mso-wrap-distance-left:9pt;\r\n mso-wrap-distance-top:0;mso-wrap-distance-right:9pt;\r\n mso-wrap-distance-bottom:0;mso-position-horizontal:center;\r\n mso-position-horizontal-relative:margin;mso-position-vertical:absolute;\r\n mso-position-vertical-relative:text;mso-width-percent:0;mso-height-percent:0;\r\n mso-width-relative:margin;mso-height-relative:margin\'>\r\n <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/paula/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png\"\r\n  o:title=\"Past Continuous Tense – Definition, Structure, Usage &amp; Examples\"\r\n  croptop=\"5989f\" cropbottom=\"5029f\"/>\r\n <w:wrap anchorx=\"margin\"/>\r\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><span style=\"mso-ignore:vglayout;position:\r\nabsolute;z-index:-1895825408;margin-left:0px;margin-top:76px;width:444px;\r\nheight:355px\"><img width=\"355\" height=\"284\" src=\"file:///C:/Users/paula/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image002.jpg\" alt=\"Past Continuous Tense – Definition, Structure, Usage &amp; Examples\" v:shapes=\"Imagen_x0020_2\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></b><img src=\"/icfes_platform/assets/uploads/contenidos/385afc60a64c6fa4d0643a6feacffc2f_1789346984.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 50%;\" alt=\"Captura de pantalla 2026-09-13 194931.png\" class=\"\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">NO SE USA EN\r\nVERBOS DE ESTADO: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Solo\r\nle cambiamos la estructura a pasado simple, (porque son verbos irregulares).</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Symbol;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Symbol;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;·<span style=\"font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><i style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">I\r\nwas knowing the answer.</span></i><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n(Incorrecto)</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Symbol;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Symbol;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;·<span style=\"font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><i style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">I\r\nknew the answer.</span></i><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n(Correcto: pasado simple).</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">¿CUÁNDO LO\r\nUTILIZAMOS?<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Acción\r\nen progreso en un momento del pasado:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Como se dijo al inicio, se\r\nusa para indicar que algo estaba ocurriendo en un momento especifico:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Example:</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#22282D;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#22282D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;\r\npadding:0cm;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">At 8pm, I was watching TV. </span></i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#22282D;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">(A las 8pm, estaba viendo la televisión).</span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 40, 45); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Para\r\nexpresar un cambio:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Nos resulta útil para\r\nindicar un cambio de opinión o un cambio en las circunstancias:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Example:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#22282D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">It\r\nwas raining this morning, but now the sun has<u> <span style=\"background:aqua;\r\nmso-highlight:aqua\">come</span></u> out. </span></i><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#22282D;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">(Estaba lloviendo\r\nesta mañana, pero ahora ha salido el sol).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#22282D;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" align=\"right\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;\r\nmso-add-space:auto;text-align:right\"><i><u><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#22282D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;\r\npadding:0cm;background:aqua;mso-highlight:aqua;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Irregular\r\nverb (Verbo irregular).</span></u></i><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: start;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Hablar\r\nde acciones interrumpidas:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Indica <b>acciones que se\r\nvieron interrumpidas y resultaron inconclusas</b>:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Example:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#22282D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">My\r\nfriend was dancing when she <u><span style=\"background:aqua;mso-highlight:aqua\">fell.</span></u>\r\n</span></i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#22282D;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">(Mi amiga estaba bailando cuando se cayó).</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Acciones\r\nsimultáneas:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Para hablar de dos o más\r\nacciones que ocurrían al mismo tiempo en el pasado:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Example:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#22282D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">She\r\nwas reading while he was working. </span></i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#22282D;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">(Ella estaba leyendo mientras él trabajaba).</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Pedir\r\nun favor de manera formal:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Un\r\nuso especial del pasado continuo es para pedir favores de manera formal y\r\nrespetuosa:<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Example:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:Montserrat;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\ncolor:#22282D;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;\r\npadding:0cm;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">&nbsp;</span></i><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">I was\r\nwondering if you could come over. </span></i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">(Me preguntaba si podrías\r\nvenir).</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><div class=\"important-box\"><div class=\"bloque-label\">⚠️ IMPORTANTE</div><p>Al final encontraras una lista descargable de los verbos irregulares para imprimir, un video explicativo y juegos interactivos para entender mejor la lección.</p></div><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p><br></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"margin-left:39.0pt;mso-add-space:\r\nauto\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nline-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></p>', '9'),
(52, 5, 22, 'Verb To Be', 'Verbo to be (Ser o estar)', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">Es un verbo que, en conjunto con pronombres, funciona para referirnos a\r\nacciones o estados de una cosa, lugar o persona, en diferentes tiempos, este\r\nverbo puede funcionar como verbo principal o verbo auxiliar, las traducciones\r\nmás frecuentes se derivan en ser o estar, pero su significado varia según la construcción\r\nde la oración, por ejemplo, <i><u>I am 20 years old</u></i> se traduce con\r\ntener <i><u><span style=\"background:aqua;mso-highlight:aqua\">(“Tengo 20 años”)</span>\r\n</u></i>y <i><u>There are two options</u></i> expresa hay <i><u><span style=\"background:aqua;mso-highlight:aqua\">(“Hay dos opciones”)</span></u>,</i>\r\npor ende, en vez de memorizar una traducción es más fácil aprender su funcionamiento.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">Para lograr entenderlo del todo, se debe conocer su conjugación, unos\r\nejemplos serían: <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">1.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Presente: Am, is, are, que es el ser o estar.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">2.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Pasado: Was y were,se traduce a era o estaba. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">3.<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Futuro: Will be, que quiere decir será y estará.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;background:\r\naqua;mso-highlight:aqua;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">TIP:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> She, He, It </span><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">→ IS </span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;You,\r\nThey, We<b>→ ARE<o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">I <b>→AM<o:p></o:p></b></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">CUATRO FUNCIONES BÁSICAS:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Identidad y clasificación:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> Une el sujeto\r\ncon un nombre que indica quién o qué es:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Marta <u><span style=\"background:aqua;mso-highlight:\r\naqua\">is</span> </u>an engineer. (Maya es ingeniera).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Estado, cualidad o ubicación: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Conecta el\r\nsujeto con un adjetivo o una expresión de lugar:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">The room <u><span style=\"background:aqua;\r\nmso-highlight:aqua\">is</span></u> quiet. Your keys <u><span style=\"background:\r\naqua;mso-highlight:aqua\">are</span> </u>on the desk. (La habitación está\r\ntranquila. Tus llaves están sobre el escritorio).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Existencia: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Con there + be, la estructura\r\npresenta algo; en español suele corresponder a “hay”:<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">There <u><span style=\"background:aqua;mso-highlight:\r\naqua\">are</span></u> two seats left. (Quedan dos asientos).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Auxiliar: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Aporta tiempo y concordancia: <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">They <u><span style=\"background:aqua;mso-highlight:\r\naqua\">are</span></u> studying. The lesson <u><span style=\"background:aqua;\r\nmso-highlight:aqua\">was</span></u> recorded. (Están estudiando. La lección fue\r\ngrabada).<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">ESTRUCTURA GENERAL:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">&nbsp;Afirmativa:\r\n     </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n     ES-CO\">Sujeto + verbo <i>to be</i> + complemento.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">&nbsp;You are fine (Estás bien).<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Negativa:\r\n     </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n     ES-CO\">Sujeto + verbo <i>to be</i> + <i>not </i>+ complemento.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">You are not fine (No estás bien).<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">&nbsp;Interrogativa</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">: Verbo <i>to\r\n     be</i> +sujeto + complemento + ?<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></li>\r\n</ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">&nbsp;Are you fine? (¿Estás bien?).<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">CUADRO GUÍA:<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"796\" style=\"width: 597pt; margin-left: -77.95pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;border-left:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;\r\n  border-bottom:solid #DCE3E6 1.0pt;border-right:none;mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-left-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #DCE3E6 .75pt;\r\n  background:#F5F8F9;padding:4.5pt 18.0pt 4.5pt 18.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Pieza&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid #DCE3E6 1.0pt;border-right:none;mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #DCE3E6 .75pt;background:#F5F8F9;padding:4.5pt 18.0pt 4.5pt 18.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Forma</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ansi-language:EN;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid #DCE3E6 1.0pt;border-right:none;mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #DCE3E6 .75pt;background:#F5F8F9;padding:4.5pt 18.0pt 4.5pt 18.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Para que sirve </span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid #DCE3E6 1.0pt;border-right:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #DCE3E6 .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-right-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;background:#F5F8F9;padding:4.5pt 18.0pt 4.5pt 18.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Ejemplo</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ansi-language:EN;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;\r\n  border-bottom:solid #DCE3E6 1.0pt;border-right:none;mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #DCE3E6 .75pt;padding:4.5pt 18.0pt 4.5pt 18.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n  ES-CO\">Infinitivo<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-width: medium medium 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(220, 227, 230); padding: 4.5pt 18pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ansi-language:EN;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">to be</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-width: medium medium 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(220, 227, 230); padding: 4.5pt 18pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n  ES-CO\">Nombrar el verbo tras ciertas construcciones.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #DCE3E6 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #DCE3E6 .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-right-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;padding:4.5pt 18.0pt 4.5pt 18.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ansi-language:EN;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">I want to be clear.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Quiero ser\r\n  claro.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;\r\n  border-bottom:solid #DCE3E6 1.0pt;border-right:none;mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #DCE3E6 .75pt;background:#F5F8F9;padding:4.5pt 18.0pt 4.5pt 18.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Forma base</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-width: medium medium 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(220, 227, 230); background: rgb(245, 248, 249); padding: 4.5pt 18pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">be</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-width: medium medium 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(220, 227, 230); background: rgb(245, 248, 249); padding: 4.5pt 18pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Después de modales y de\r\n  will.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n  ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #DCE3E6 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #DCE3E6 .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-right-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;background:#F5F8F9;padding:4.5pt 18.0pt 4.5pt 18.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">You must be careful.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Debes tener\r\n  cuidado.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n  ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;\r\n  border-bottom:solid #DCE3E6 1.0pt;border-right:none;mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #DCE3E6 .75pt;padding:4.5pt 18.0pt 4.5pt 18.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n  ES-CO\">Presente<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-width: medium medium 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(220, 227, 230); padding: 4.5pt 18pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ansi-language:EN;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">am · is · are</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-width: medium medium 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(220, 227, 230); padding: 4.5pt 18pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n  ES-CO\">Hechos, identidad, estados y ubicación actuales.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #DCE3E6 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #DCE3E6 .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-right-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;padding:4.5pt 18.0pt 4.5pt 18.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-ansi-language:EN;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">We are ready.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Estamos\r\n  listos.<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;\r\n  border-bottom:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;border-right:none;mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;background:#F5F8F9;padding:4.5pt 18.0pt 4.5pt 18.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Pasado</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-width: medium medium 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(238, 238, 238); background: rgb(245, 248, 249); padding: 4.5pt 18pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">was · were</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-width: medium medium 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgb(238, 238, 238); background: rgb(245, 248, 249); padding: 4.5pt 18pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Los mismos significados\r\n  situados en el pasado.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;\r\n  border-right:solid #EEEEEE 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;\r\n  mso-border-right-alt:solid #EEEEEE .75pt;background:#F5F8F9;padding:4.5pt 18.0pt 4.5pt 18.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">She was at home.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Ella estaba\r\n  en casa.</span></b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\n  ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><div class=\"important-box\"><div class=\"bloque-label\">⚠️ IMPORTANTE</div><p>Al final encontraras un video sencillo para entender el tema de manera más practica y unos juegos interactivos para que pruebes que tanto aprendiste en esta lección.</p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\"><br></span></b></p><p><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\"><br></span></b></p><p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><br>', '9');
INSERT INTO `temas` (`id_tema`, `id_materia`, `id_unidad`, `nombre`, `descripcion`, `contenido`, `grado`) VALUES
(53, 5, 23, 'Modal Verbs', 'Verbos modales', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Son verbos\r\nauxiliares que modifican al verbo principal, comunicando certidumbre,\r\nhabilidad, necesidad, disposición, obligación o condición, permitiendo decir no\r\nsolo que ocurre,sino también si puede llegar a ser una acción hipotética o lo\r\nque mencione anteriormente.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Ejemplo:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">En <b>I work</b>,\r\nsolo afirmas que trabajas. <o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">En <b>I can work</b>,\r\nexpresas capacidad.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">En <b>I must work</b>,\r\nobligación.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">En <b>I might work</b>,\r\nposibilidad.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><i><u>El verbo principal no cambia, pero la\r\nintención sí.<o:p></o:p></u></i></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Tips a tener en\r\ncuenta:<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>No\r\nse conjugan con los sujetos:</b>\r\nNo hay que agregarles “s” al final ni nada por el estilo.<b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>No\r\ntienen infinitivo:</b> Por\r\nejemplo, no existe <i>to can (Poder).</i><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>No\r\ntienen gerundio: </b>Por\r\nejemplo, no existe <i>mighting (Podría).</i><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>No\r\ntienen participio:</b> Por\r\nejemplo, no existe <i>willed (Haré)</i><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>Modifican\r\na otros verbos:</b> Por lo que\r\ndespués de un <i>modal verb</i> siempre hay un verbo en su forma infinitiva,\r\ncomo: You <b><i>can eat</i></b> better (Tú puedes comer mejor).<b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>La\r\nforma negativa o interrogativa no necesita de un auxiliar: </b>Ya que el verbo está echo para usarse en\r\nestos fines, por ejemplo: I <b><i><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">can\'t </span></i></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">swim (No sé nadar) o Can you drive? (¿Puedes\r\nmanejar?)</span><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Estructura\r\ngeneral:<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"/icfes_platform/assets/uploads/contenidos/21c801a4962e3db34e88fbf7d5e864bd_1789419782.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\" alt=\"Captura de pantalla 2026-09-14 155152.png\"><b><br></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype\r\n id=\"_x0000_t75\" coordsize=\"21600,21600\" o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\"\r\n path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\" filled=\"f\" stroked=\"f\">\r\n <v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"/>\r\n <v:formulas>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"/>\r\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"/>\r\n </v:formulas>\r\n <v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"/>\r\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\"/>\r\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"Imagen_x0020_1\" o:spid=\"_x0000_i1025\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"\r\n style=\'width:498pt;height:199.2pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square\'>\r\n <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/paula/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png\"\r\n  o:title=\"\"/>\r\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!--[if !vml]--><!--[endif]--></b><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Más usados:<o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Los modal verbs más\r\nusado en inglés son:<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>Can </b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">→ Puede.</span></b><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>Could\r\n</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">→Podría.</span></b><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>May </b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">→ Puede. </span></b><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>Might\r\n</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">→ Quizás.</span></b><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>Will\r\n</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">→ Hará.</span></b><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>Would\r\n</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">→ Haría.</span></b><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>Must\r\n</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">→ Debe.</span></b><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>Shall\r\n</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">→Deberá.</span></b><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b>Should\r\n</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">→ Debería.</span></b><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>CAN: </b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Expresa\r\nhabilidad o posibilidad.</span><b><o:p></o:p></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Affirmative:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> I<i> <b>can</b></i> speak\r\nenglish = Puedo hablar inglés.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Negative:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> He <b><i>can’t</i></b><i> </i>go with you = Él no\r\npuede acompañarte<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo3\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Question:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> <b><i>Can</i></b><i> </i>you help me? = ¿Me puedes\r\nayudar?<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">COULD: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Es la forma pasada de can, pero también se usa para\r\nexpresar posibilidad. Además, sirve para preguntar con un tono de formalidad (normalmente\r\npara hacer solicitudes a quien nos escucha).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l8 level1 lfo4\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Affirmative:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> You <b><i>could</i></b><i> </i>use\r\nmy chair = Podrías usar mi silla.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l8 level1 lfo4\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Negative:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> She <b><i>could not</i></b> go to the market with\r\nus = Ella no pudo ir al mercado con nosotras.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l8 level1 lfo4\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Question:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> <b><i>Could</i></b><i> </i>you open the door,\r\nplease? = ¿Podrías abrirme la puerta, por favor?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">MAY: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">Se utiliza para expresar posibilidad y probabilidad.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo5\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Affirmative:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> She<b> <i>may</i></b> pass the\r\ntest = Ella podría aprobar el examen.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo5\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Negative:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> It <b><i>may not</i></b> snow tomorrow = Mañana podría\r\nno nevar.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo5\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Question:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> <b><i>May</i></b> I come in? = ¿Puedo entrar?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">MIGHT:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\"> Se usa para dar sugerencias y posibilidades, así como para expresar peticiones\r\ny ofrecimientos.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Affirmative:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> My sister <b><i>might</i></b>\r\ncome home for my birthday = Mi hermana tal vez pueda venir a casa para mi cumpleaños.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Negative:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> You <b><i>might not</i></b> arrive on time = Puede\r\nser que no llegues a tiempo.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l5 level1 lfo6\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Question:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> <b><i>Might</i></b> I buy you a drink = ¿Te puedo\r\ninvitar un trago?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">Will: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">Su función principal es referirse al futuro, pero también se usa para\r\nmanifestar una decisión tomada en el momento en que se habla o la intención de\r\nhacer algo.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo7\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Affirmative: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">He <b><i>will</i></b> call me\r\nback= Me va a volver a llamar<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo7\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Negative: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">I <b><i>won’t</i></b><i> </i>go with you because I\r\nhave a loto f work = No iré contigo porque tengo mucho trabajo.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo7\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Question: <i>Will</i></span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> you cover my\r\nexpenses = ¿Cubrirás mis gastos?<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">Would: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Funciona para realizar peticiones con amabilidad,\r\npara señalar acciones constantes en el pasado o casos hipotéticos.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo8\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Present tense: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">I <b><i>would </i></b>like a cup\r\nof tea, please = Me gustaría una taza de té, por favor.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo8\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Past tense: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">He <b><i>would</i></b> visit his\r\nsister every weekend = Visitaba a su hermana cada fin de semana.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo8\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Negative (Hipotetic case): </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">She <b><i>wouldn\'t</i></b><i>&nbsp;\r\n</i>go to the party even <u><span style=\"background:aqua;mso-highlight:aqua\">if</span></u>\r\nshe was invited = Ella no iría a la fiesta incluso si fuera invitada.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right\"><u><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nbackground:aqua;mso-highlight:aqua;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Condicional que\r\nse usa para cosas que pueden pasar, se analiza con mayor detalle en el tema <i>“Conditionals”</i></span></u><i><u><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><o:p></o:p></span></u></i></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo8\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Question:<i> Would</i></span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> you like to\r\ntaste it? = ¿Te gustaría probarlo? <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">Must: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">En algunas ocasiones puede significar suposiciones, pelo lo más común es\r\nque se refiera a necesidades o compromisos.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo8\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Affirmative: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">He <b><i>must </i></b>be back by\r\ntomorrow = Él debe estar aquí mañana.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo8\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Negative: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">You <b><i>must not</i></b> litter = Está prohibido\r\ntirar basura en la calle <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo8\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Question: <i>Must</i></span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> I go to the\r\ndentist today? = ¿Tengo que ir al dentista hoy? <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">Shall: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">En los últimos tiempos ha caído en desuso en\r\nEstados Unidos dentro de la lengua informal, pero en Reino Unido sigue siendo\r\nmuy común, su significado es el mismo que <i>Will. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></i></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Affirmative:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> I <b><i>shall</i></b> be at\r\nyour wedding = Estaré en tu boda.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Negative: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">You <b><i>shall</i></b> not go to the party = No\r\nvas a ir a la fiesta<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Question:<i> Shall</i></span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> we ego to\r\nthe theatre tomorrow? = ¿Vamos al teatro mañana? <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">Should:</span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> Este verbo, que se traduce como “deber”, se\r\nutiliza para una obligación o recomendación.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo10\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Affirmative: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:\r\n&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">You <b><i>should</i></b> take\r\nyour medicine = Debes tomar tu medicina.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo10\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Negative: </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">We <b><i>should not </i></b>be in this meeting =\r\nNosotros no deberíamos estar en esta reunión.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l9 level1 lfo10\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nSymbol;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">·<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span><!--[endif]--><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">Question: <i>Should</i></span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"> I rest more?\r\n= ¿Debería descansar más? <b><o:p></o:p></b></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-language:\r\nES-CO\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><div class=\"important-box\"><div class=\"bloque-label\">⚠️ IMPORTANTE</div><p>Al final encontraras un video que te explica esto a más detalle e incluso con escenas de peliculas que de seguro conoces y unos juegos interactivos para que pruebes que tanto aprendiste de esta lección.</p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><br></span></b></p><p><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-language:ES-CO\"><br></span></b></p>', '10'),
(54, 4, 18, 'Economía', NULL, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">📘 1</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Comic Sans MS&quot;; font-size: 20px;\">. Economía&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"info-box\"><div class=\"bloque-label\">💡 CONCEPTO CLAVE</div><div>🔵 EXPLICACIÓN COMPLETA: Estudia cómo las personas, empresas y Estados toman decisiones porque los recursos son limitados y las necesidades son numerosas. Analiza la producción, distribución y consumo de bienes y servicios. En el ICFES debes relacionar conceptos económicos con situaciones reales: aumento de precios, desempleo, impuestos, comercio o decisiones del Estado.</div><div>🟢 EJEMPLO: Si el precio de los alimentos sube pero el salario de una familia no aumenta, su poder adquisitivo disminuye: puede comprar menos con el mismo dinero.</div></div><div class=\"important-box\"><div class=\"bloque-label\">⚠️ IMPORTANTE</div><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;PALABRAS CLAVE: escasez • oferta • demanda • inflación • desempleo • poder adquisitivo • impuestos</span></p></div><div><br></div><div>🧩 MINI-INFOGRAFÍA: CONCEPTO → CONTEXTO → ACTORES → CAUSAS → CONSECUENCIAS → EVIDENCIA → CONCLUSIÓN</div><div class=\"exercise-box\"><div class=\"bloque-label\">📝 EJERCICIO</div><div>📝 PREGUNTA TIPO ICFES: ¿Por qué una subida general de precios puede afectar más a una familia cuyo ingreso permanece igual?</div><div>✅ RESPUESTA EXPLICADA: Porque su dinero pierde capacidad de compra: si los bienes cuestan más y el ingreso no cambia, puede adquirir una menor cantidad de productos.</div></div><div>🎮 RECURSOS INTERACTIVOS:&nbsp;</div><div>Juego : Practicar con juegos y cuestionarios en Wordwall&nbsp;</div><div><a href=\"https://wordwall.net/es-co/community/econom%C3%ADa\" target=\"_blank\">https://wordwall.net/es-co/community/econom%C3%ADa</a></div><div>🎥 Video: Buscar explicación en video&nbsp;</div><div><a href=\"https://youtu.be/hmbmoabUvPI?si=dgMFkIARwTiqYw5c\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/hmbmoabUvPI?si=dgMFkIARwTiqYw5c</a></div><div>📄 Material de estudio: <a href=\"https://colombiaaprende.edu.co/contenidos/coleccion/ciencias-sociales-e-historia\" target=\"_blank\">https://colombiaaprende.edu.co/contenidos/coleccion/ciencias-sociales-e-historia</a></div><div>⭐ CONSEJO PARA EL ICFES: Antes de marcar una respuesta, identifica qué información da la fuente y qué pregunta exactamente el enunciado. El distractor suele parecer correcto porque mezcla un dato verdadero con una conclusión que no está sustentada</div><div><img src=\"/icfes_platform/assets/uploads/contenidos/496ca700f4e2852da31847d9f77b7023_1789424273.jpg\" alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-09-14 at 17.16.06.jpeg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"><br></div>', '9');
